    "intro_narrative": "You have infiltrated the abandoned sanctum of Archmage Velryn, a legendary sorcerer who sealed his greatest creation away centuries ago. The chamber is a dizzying array of magical apparatuses, cryptic scrolls, and arcane machinery humming with dormant power. Your ultimate goal is to navigate this complex web of enchanting devices and obtain the content of the sealed artifact, rumored to hold the secret of eternal mana. To succeed, you must understand how magical energies flow between the various instruments in the room. Be wary, for every tool, crystal, and relic is connected in a delicate, unseen magical ecosystem that must be perfectly balanced.",
